<title>UK: British Polythene H1 pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>British Polythene H1 pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) (diluted)  23.21		  vs 19.86</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.25		   vs 5.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     14.26		  vs 11.51</p>
<p> Turnover		   198.70		 vs 172.86</p>
<p> Operating result	 17.60		  vs 13.64</p>
<p> Interest		   1.24		   vs 0.58</p>
<p> Tax			  4.71		   vs 3.80</p>
<p> Net taxed		  9.55		   vs 7.71</p>
<p> Attributable	     9.46		   vs 6.95</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 29</p>
<p> Div registration date  November 5</p>
<p> Ex-div date		October 28</p>
<p>Note - British Polythene Plc said it would incur short term trading losses and reorganisation costs connected with recent acquisitions of around 1.5 million stg. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
